 "remarks": "Welcome to Winnipauk Village, where comfort meets convenience! This spacious 2-bedroom, 1-bath garden-style condo offers an inviting open floor plan, perfect for everyday living and entertaining. The oversized living room features a cozy fireplace, abundant natural light, and sliding doors leading to a private covered patio overlooking peaceful green space. The thoughtfully designed layout includes a beautifully updated kitchen with white cabinetry, stainless steel appliances, stylish backsplash, and an adjoining dining area. Both bedrooms are generously sized, including a spacious primary with large closets, while the renovated bathroom offers modern finishes. Additional highlights include updated flooring, in-unit laundry, and plenty of storage throughout. The floor plan provides an efficient layout with a large living room, spacious bedrooms, and covered patio. Enjoy resort-style amenities including a pool, fitness center, tennis and pickleball courts, and beautifully maintained grounds. Ideally located just minutes from shopping, restaurants, beaches, Metro-North, I-95, Route 7, and the Merritt Parkway, this move-in-ready home offers low-maintenance living in one of Norwalk's most desirable communities.",
